logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
components/node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
crates/mbr-core/templates/components-js
*.local
result
